WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.240
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:48.250
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:50.260
You're kidding!

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:52.360
It sounds like Sae-chan did some
maneuvering behind the scenes.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.600
Why, that little!

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:00.370
M- Momo-chan... calm down...

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:04.070
That rotten Sae!!

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:10.750
"'A {ure and {roper Break-up Declaration"'

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:15.060
M- Momo-chan! Too fast! Too fast!

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.960
You shush! Keep quiet,
or I'll bite your tongue!

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:23.300
My tailbone! My tailbone!

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:29.740
You've got to be kidding me! How can
I be the only one who didn't know!?

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:32.740
How could the whole class
take Sae's side!?

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:37.010
Ah, it makes me sick just thinking
about that triumphant look on Sae's face!

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:46.090
Listen, you've got to make it clear to
Toji how you were the one who hugged me!

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:48.990
You can bet that Sae is brainwashing Toji

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.430
to think something happened
that never did!

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:52.760
F- fine, but what's
the deal with my hands?

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:56.100
That's to keep you from touching me
where you shouldn't be!

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:58.440
You don't mean that!

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.700
Just you wait, Sae!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.230
You're not getting away with it!
Not this time!

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:11.050
I thought it was odd when you
first told me about it, Toji.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:15.390
Why would it be necessary for you to hide
the fact that you were seeing each other?

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:18.060
But after today, I think I understand why.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:21.390
Momo-chan is seeing Okayasu
while she's going out with you, Toji.

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:24.730
I don't want to speak ill of a friend,

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:28.070
but I didn't think Momo-chan
was that kind of person.

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:31.400
If it were me, there's no way I would
put up with someone who two-timed me!

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:35.070
I wouldn't let them do it!
I'd leave them right away!

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:39.270
Oh, I'm sorry! I'm not telling you
that you should break up, Toji!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:46.420
Geez, why is this train so slow!?
Is the operator asleep, or what?

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:51.090
Say, Momo-chan, let's sit down.
I know you're in a hurry,

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:54.090
but walking along inside the train
isn't going to get us there any faster.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:58.190
I know it won't! I know that...

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:02.030
...but when I think of Sae
and Toji all alone together...

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:03.970
Here! "'Aaah"'

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.710
Say, how come you
and Sae-chan are friends?

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.640
We aren't particularly friends.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:18.500
I thought we were friends
at the beginning, though.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:23.390
I came down with rubella just before
our school entrance ceremony,

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:25.720
and I stayed home the first week of school.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:30.060
And when I got there, everyone had
already formed their groups of friends,

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:32.400
and I was left drifting
around the class by myself.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.300
The one thing that I was happy about

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:37.070
was the fact that I was
in the same class as Toji,

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:41.410
but I couldn't very well
just talk to him all the time.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:46.410
But then, the thing about me is the way
I look, right? While I was absent,

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:48.510
there were awful rumors flying around

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.750
about how maybe I was
just out fooling around.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:51.750
Seriously?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.890
Well, I heard about
all of this later from Sae,

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:57.180
so I don't know how much of it is true.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:08.030
Anyhow, I was lonely, and discouraged,
and then Sae started talking to me.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.630
Adachi-san, do you remember me?

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:13.300
I borrowed your eraser
during the entrance exam.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:18.070
I was really happy at the time.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:22.450
But I should have realized then
that Sae had been left out,

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:26.210
and no one would let her
into their group.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:35.730
lt's possible that Toji won't
be the same Toji he was before.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:39.060
Sae's mind control
might have changed him.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:43.730
Then again, if Toji still likes me,

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.290
then l'm sure l'll have another chance...

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.070
Are you okay, Toji!?

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.410
Sorry, I wasn't paying attention.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:55.080
Here, wipe your clothes with this.
I'll clean this right up.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.750
It's great that you have
such a nice girlfriend.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.480
I- it's not like that!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.030
Kashiwagi?

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:16.030
What's wrong?

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.190
Nothing, really.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.040
So Toji really is in the hospital, huh?

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:29.380
Thanks, Okayasu.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.720
For telling me about Toji.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:37.390
If you hadn't told me, I'm sure I wouldn't
have found out until Toji was discharged.

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:42.550
I kind of hate to admit it, but you're
the only friend I have right now.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:44.730
Momo-chan!

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.720
I'm just saying!

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:52.400
Say, Toji, don't you think maybe
you should change your clothes?

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.740
I'll wash them.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.070
That's okay, I couldn't ask you to.

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:58.080
It's okay, it's okay.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:01.010
There are fresh pajamas
on top of that shelf, right?

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.910
No, I mean...

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.350
I'm sorry, Toji!

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:07.350
That's okay.

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:09.350
I didn't hit your scar, did I?

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:11.120
Mm-mm.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.050
Wha- what are you doing!?

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:44.720
Sae! How dare you!

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.590
How dare you do this!

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.400
Toji...

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:55.760
Kashiwagi just slipped on the tea
that I spilled, and fell on top of me.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.870
With such convenient timing as this?

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.670
Almost as though she knew
we would be coming?

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:07.010
Before you go criticizing others,
what about yourself?

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.350
What is he doing here?

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:14.220
Oh, me? Right! I'm here as
Momo-chan's defense counsel.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:20.020
I believe you've already heard
the details of today's case,

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.360
but Momo-chan is concerned

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:25.360
that maybe there has been
a case of misunderstanding here.

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:28.370
And so, I have accompanied
her here, at her behest.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.370
Would you be serious about this!?

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:35.200
Now, Momo-chan, you haven't seen Toji
in a long time, so start by saying hello.

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:45.120
I- I'm sorry, Toji, for not
coming to visit you right away.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.720
I didn't know you were in the hospital.

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:50.050
You're a fine one to lie like that.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.390
Sae!

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.720
What Momo-chan said is true.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:58.060
She really didn't know that you were
in the hospital until today, Toji.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:00.800
And while I'm at it, I should say
that you've got it all wrong

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.330
about me and Momo-chan
hugging each other.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.130
What happened was I was
about to fall down,

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:06.670
and Momo-chan grabbed onto me.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:07.500
They're lying, they're lying!

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.010
Toji, these two have worked out
their stories to match each other!

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:11.010
Okayasu!

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.340
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.680
What!?

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.680
Hey, stop it! What are you doing!?

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.680
Where do you think you're taking me!?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.950
You're getting along
pretty well with Okayasu, huh?

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.350
That's just because we talk
when we see each other.

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:28.360
Why? He's got a thing for you, Adachi!

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:32.030
So why would you act like
there's something going on between you?

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:33.700
Like there's something going on?

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:36.500
And as for misunderstandings,
you could have come alone, right?

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.030
Don't bring that guy along!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:39.800
Well, Toji, why don't you tell me

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:43.710
if you would have listened to me
if I had come alone?

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.380
You're always taking Sae's word over mine!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:49.380
That's just because you're
mistaken about Kashiwagi, Adachi.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.720
You're the one who's mistaken, Toji!

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:55.390
Why won't you believe what I say,
but you will believe what Sae says!?

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:58.390
Kashiwagi doesn't have
any reason to lie to me!

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:02.050
It wouldn't do Kashiwagi
any good to deceive me!

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:12.190
So, you won't believe me,
no matter what I do?

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:23.410
Adachi!

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.420
You say Sae has no reason to lie to you!?

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:27.750
That it wouldn't do her
any good to trick you, Toji!?

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:32.090
Sure it would! {lenty!
Sae is after you, Toji!

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:34.420
Adachi, just come down from there!
It's dangerous!

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:38.900
No! I'm too frustrated! I'm terribly
frustrated because I love you, Toji,

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.770
but I can't even get you to believe me!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:43.530
Listen to what I'm telling you...

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:47.770
Like you did that
first time we had tea together...

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:50.770
If you won't listen to me,
I'm going to jump down from here!

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:52.440
Don't do it, miss!

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.780
If you fall, you're going to hurt yourself!

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.750
That would be fine with me.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:58.780
If I break my leg and have
to be admitted into the hospital,

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.020
then like it or not, Toji,

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:01.950
I would have plenty of time
to talk face-to-face with you.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.560
Hold on! You like Momo-chan, don't you?

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.060
Why would you do this when
there's nothing in it for you?

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:12.760
It's because Momo-chan is counting on me.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.400
M- Momo-chan, what are you doing!?

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:20.740
Adachi, it's too dangerous there!
Come over here now!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.410
Then promise me!

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.740
Everything I have to say
about the Sae that I know!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:30.080
All right! I promise! I promise I will!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.420
You have to! You have to
hear me out until I'm done!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.680
Yeah, I'll hear you out.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.580
Come on.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.030
Momo-chan!

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:20.160
How can she do that to me!?
I was this close!

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:26.070
Listen, you want to team up with me?

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:29.740
I mean, the two of us both
have the same goal, right?

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.410
I want Toji, and you want Momo-chan.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:35.670
Which means, if we team up,
we'll be unbeatable!

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:52.200
I'm sorry, this is my fault.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.100
I wasn't even thinking about
your physical condition, Toji.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:57.430
You were positively out of control, huh?

00:12:57.430 --> 00:13:01.710
Saying you were going to jump if I didn't
listen to you is almost extortion.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:06.040
W- well, if I hadn't done that, I didn't
think you would have listened to me!

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:09.810
Well, let's hear what
you have to say, Adachi.

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:13.380
Finally... finally!

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:16.280
Now l can clear my name of everything
that's happened up to now!

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:19.720
What do you say?
Feel like teaming up with me?

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:23.160
Y'know, I never even thought about that.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:25.730
It's true, if we teamed up,
we'd be unbeatable, huh?

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:27.060
Right? Right?

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:29.070
So, what specifically would we do?

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:33.740
Isn't it obvious? The first thing
we do is prevent them from making up.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:37.740
Whatever we do, we have to first
strike a decisive blow to them.

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:40.080
Decisive how?

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:43.080
Let's see, for instance... a fait accompli.

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:44.750
A fait accompli!?

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:50.420
Toji, wake up! Toji!

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:54.760
Kashiwagi? What are you
doing here at this hour-?

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:56.090
K- Kashiwagi!

00:13:56.090 --> 00:14:00.700
I love you! Toji, I love you
so much, I can't stand it!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.370
N- no, Kashiwagi!

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:05.370
No, I say!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:09.710
Something along those lines. Right now,
Toji isn't quite able-bodied,

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:12.710
so if I closed in on him,
I doubt he could run away.

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:17.710
Whoo, that's awesome!
That's beyond awesome! What a bold plan!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.270
You're quite the strategist! An operator!

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:25.050
Huh? But what role will I play in this?

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:27.590
You will keep Momo-chan
standing by someplace close

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.730
until I've got everything ready.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:32.400
And then, when I send you
a text message to signal you...

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:34.730
I'll take Momo-chan in to where you are!

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.170
You see? You do get it, don't you?

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:41.600
And, since Toji is so straitlaced,

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.070
I'll beg him in tears
to do the responsible thing,

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:46.080
and I don't think there's any way
he's going to say no to me.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.950
And then, once Toji
breaks up with Momo-chan,

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:52.750
you'll be there immediately
to comfort her broken heart.

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:56.480
There's nothing easier to take advantage
of than someone who is feeling downcast.

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:07.550
W- what are you doing?

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.030
You're such a naughty little girl, huh?

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:13.740
--I'm impressed by how such things
can come out of this naughty mouth,
--Let go of me! Let go of me!

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:15.370
one after another.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:17.370
Hang on! What do you mean by that!?

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:19.360
You say you want to team up with me?

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:21.870
There's no way in hell.

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:27.050
Well... well, first of all...

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.390
I know! Let's pick up
where that phone call left off.

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:32.560
Sorry, just a minute.

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.060
Before I hear what you have to say,

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:36.390
there's one thing that
I just have to make sure of.

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:37.390
What's that?

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:40.060
After that, I'll listen to
what you have to tell me, Adachi.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:44.070
Man, l want to hurry up and
expose Sae for who she really is!

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:47.070
So, what did you want to make sure of?

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:49.070
It's about Okayasu.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:51.410
What do you think of him?

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.410
Are you sure you don't have more fun

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:56.080
when you're with him
than you do with me, Adachi?

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.250
Oh, come on, Toji!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:01.350
Like I say, the reason why you think that
is because Sae has been brainwashing you!

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.020
No, it isn't.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:08.020
What Kashiwagi said does bother me,
but long before that-

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.160
before I even started
going out with you, Adachi-

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.700
I was worried about it.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.260
Adachi, I declared my love for you

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:18.370
because I was worried that if I didn't
look out, he'd take you away from me.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:23.510
O- oh, no, Toji! There's no way
I could like Okayasu!

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:26.040
Not that lecherous perv beyond all hope!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.100
Sorry.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:32.620
But when you're with him, Adachi,
you seem more natural,

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:35.050
and really full of life, and what's more,

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.750
he seems to be more like you, Adachi.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:42.390
You mean, I'm a nitwit, too?

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.720
No, that's not what I'm saying-

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:54.400
Feel that? That's my heart.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:58.070
It only beats this fast
when I'm with you, Toji.

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:01.910
When Okayasu hugged me,
and said he liked me,

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:05.240
I never once felt excited like this.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:10.410
You're the only one I've liked,
ever since middle school.

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:21.030
Oh my goodness.

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.030
Aww...

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:25.700
Well, you know how it is.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:28.900
How many days has it been
since l've had such a serene time?

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:33.140
Too bad, huh?

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:37.710
It's only a matter of time before
your mind control over Toji is lifted.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:41.050
This would be a good opportunity
for you to pull out of here.

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:45.390
And then what? Are you going
to give up on Momo-chan like this?

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:47.720
Why do I have to give up on her?

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.660
What do you mean!? Aren't you
contradicting yourself!?

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:55.060
You just told me to quit!

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:56.330
Well after all, Sae-chan,

00:17:56.330 --> 00:18:00.070
it's not like you ever
seriously liked Toji anyway, did you?

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:03.010
You just got involved with him because
he was someone that Momo-chan liked,

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:04.670
right, "'Copycat Sae-chan"'?

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:06.340
I hate you!

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:10.880
Yeah, yeah. Still,
you'll never win Toji's heart

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:13.020
by using dirty tricks
to get him to notice you.

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:15.350
If you're going to do it,
you have to play fair.

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:21.690
Now, there's not much that I can brag
about either, but I did kiss Momo-chan.

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:24.690
You mean, those rumors weren't false?

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.360
Nope.

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:27.700
Thanks, Okayasu.

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:30.370
Bye-bee!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:32.930
Oh no! Did I say something
I shouldn't have!?

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:37.100
I've got it! The decisive blow!

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:41.040
Huh? I changed our meeting spot
to the cafeteria?

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:43.380
I never said anything of the sort.

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:47.720
Then, that was one of Kashiwagi's lies?
Why would she do such a thing?

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.390
I told you, Sae is after you, Toji.

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:52.820
But Kashiwagi would be
the last one to do that...

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:57.590
You know, I've said this before,

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:01.000
but Sae really does have a gift
when it comes to telling lies.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.930
What's more, she wants to copy
everything anyone else does.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.670
Don't let her fool you, Toji!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:10.670
Momo-chan is the real liar here, after all!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:14.340
W- what did you say? When did I ever lie!?

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:17.680
Isn't it obvious?
Your relationship with Okayasu-kun!

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:18.680
What are you talking about?

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:21.550
Don't play dumb! You kissed him!

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.360
You did kiss Okayasu-kun, didn't you?

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:29.690
I'm sorry, Momo-chan! It slipped out!

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.690
Huh? Am I too late?

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.530
Is it true what she just said?
Did you kiss him?

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.040
No, no! Toji, what happened was-

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.660
I'm not asking you!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.040
How about it, Adachi?

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.370
Did you kiss this guy?

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.170
Don't say it! Don't say it!

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:56.390
What for?

00:19:56.390 --> 00:20:00.390
I'm sorry, Toji. But it's
not as though I lied to you.

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:03.730
I mean, it happened before
I started going out with you, Toji.

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:06.400
Are you saying it doesn't matter what
you did before we started going out?

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:09.400
B- but I didn't even
have a chance to resist!

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:12.060
Before I knew it, he was
already kissing me...

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:14.930
And when I did it, you rejected me.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.080
You really do like Okayasu, don't you?

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:22.750
No! You're the only one I like, Toji!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:26.080
How do you know? Are you sure you
didn't fall for him when he kissed you?

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:27.910
Of course I didn't!

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:32.160
What were you doing with him
while I was absent?

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.420
Were the two of you laughing about me?

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:39.990
That's enough, you hard-headed
know-nothing! You kissed Sae, too!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.430
Why did I reject your kiss, Toji?

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:47.070
Because you tried to kiss me
on the same day,

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:48.440
in the same place as you did Sae!

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:51.070
What about you, Toji!?
Why did you kiss Sae!?

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:53.440
It wasn't a kiss.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:56.450
That's not true! I saw you!

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:59.450
It was a kiss, but it wasn't a kiss.

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:00.380
Then what was it?

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:04.050
Rehearsing.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.420
For when you were going
to kiss Momo-chan, right?

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:10.390
It couldn't be. You're kidding, right?

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:12.060
Toji?

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:15.000
You don't mean, you thought
you were doing it for me,

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.400
and did what Sae told you to?

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:18.530
Yeah...

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:21.740
What are you, an idiot!?

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:24.940
What planet is it where guys
use other girls to practice kissing on

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:27.410
for when they kiss their girlfriends!?

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:33.080
I didn't think you were that stupid, Toji!
I've misjudged you! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:35.450
If I'm an idiot, then you're a liar, Adachi!

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:42.430
I don't know what's going through
your head anymore, Adachi.

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:44.860
I don't think I can go on anymore.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:48.460
Let's break up.

00:21:56.110 --> 00:21:58.440
You can get bent!

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:02.040
How can sound so self-important!?
How can you say "'Let's break up"'!?

00:22:02.040 --> 00:22:04.380
l'm the one who should be saying that!

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:07.720
Toji... Toji...

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:10.020
l'm breaking up with you!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:14.550
Momo-chan! Wait! Momo-chan!

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:43.250
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:52.920
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:55.930
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.930 --> 00:23:02.530
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:08.870
Where can we go

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:18.550
where we can all be

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:21.220
under the same sky?

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:29.560
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.560 --> 00:23:36.230
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.230 --> 00:23:42.570
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.570 --> 00:23:49.680
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:57.490
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.860 --> 00:24:05.600
A swim meet? Sae,
why are you nominating me!?

00:24:05.600 --> 00:24:07.870
Curse you, Sae! Curse you, Sae!

00:24:07.870 --> 00:24:11.200
Are you a parasite that feeds
off of other people's unhappiness!?

00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:14.930
Next time on {each Girl,
"'A Sizzling, Tempestuous Swim Meet"'
